  "answer_text": "Here are some great places where you can order a birthday cake online:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf82 1. **Goldbelly** (goldbelly.com)\nGoldbelly curates a collection of delicious and beautiful birthday cakes baked with love at the United States' most famous bakeries, and they're available for nationwide delivery. Top bakers like Carousel Cakes, Daisy Cakes, and We Take the Cake offer options including gluten-free, kosher, nut-free, and Paleo birthday cakes.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf82 2. **Milk Bar** (milkbarstore.com)\nMilk Bar's bestselling Birthday Cake, inspired by the boxed vanilla funfetti cake, features three tiers of rainbow-flecked vanilla birthday cake with layers of creamy frosting, crunchy crumbs, and rainbow sprinkles. You can select a delivery date at checkout up to 30 days in advance, and for time-sensitive events, they recommend scheduling delivery at least 3 or more days ahead of the celebration.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf82 3. **Bake Me A Wish** (bakemeawish.com)\nBake Me A Wish offers a wide variety of cakes including German Chocolate Cake, Tiramisu Classico Cake, Carrot Cake, and more, with options for personalized cakes, zodiac cakes, and gluten-free selections.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf82 4. **Harry & David** (harryanddavid.com)\nTheir gourmet cakes, specialty desserts, and cheesecakes are handcrafted in their Southern Oregon bakery and delivered nationwide. They offer classic birthday cakes in chocolate, vanilla, and confetti; decadent cheesecakes including flavors from The Cheesecake Factory; and seasonal specialties like tiramisu, lava cake, carrot cake, and limoncello.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf82 5. **Publix Bakery** (publix.com)\nPublix hand-decorates custom cakes in-store to suit your occasion, with a wide selection of themes featuring sports, TV shows, movies, and even Disney Pixar characters, and you can customize flavor, filling, and icing. You can design and order your Publix cake online for in-store pickup, and ordering 24 hours before your event is all you need.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf82 6. **Whole Foods Market** (wholefoodsmarket.com)\nWhole Foods offers cult-favorite cakes like the Berry Chantilly Cake and the Chocolate Eruption Cake, and all cakes must be made with quality ingredients \u2014 including unbleached flour, cage-free eggs, and no high-fructose corn syrup or artificial colors. Many locations offer cakes that can be ordered ahead online for easy in-store pickup.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf82 7. **Walmart** (walmart.com/order-ahead/cake)\nWalmart also offers an online custom cake ordering service for in-store pickup, making it a convenient and budget-friendly option.\n\n---\n\nEach of these options has something unique to offer, whether you're looking for nationwide delivery, custom designs, or a quick local pickup. Happy birthday planning! \ud83c\udf89",
